    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Generating the UUID",
      "description" : "Generates a unique identifier (UUID) for use within agent tools and MCP workflows. This UUID can be used to uniquely identify entities such as tool executions, MCP components, requests, or internal workflow instances. An optional description can be provided to add context to the generated identifier.\n\nInput Parameters:\ndescription (string): Optional description providing context for the UUID generation.\n\nOutput Parameters:\nuuid (string): System-generated unique identifier."
    },
